*** Settings ***

Documentation
...   description: CB009019
...   last update: scout data and RF50 fixes

Library     ute_tshark
Library     ta5g_tshark
Library     CB009019_resources.py
Resource    ../../resources_KRK/robot/common_keywords.robot
Resource    ../../../../resources/SWENG/robot/Setup.robot
Library     taf.sw.scout                    WITH NAME    scout
Library     taf.sw.reporting_portal         WITH NAME    reporting_portal


*** Keywords ***
Deregister UE${UE_ID} and clear up test environment
    Stop tshark   alias=tcp_mss
    Deregister UE  UE_ID=${UE_ID}
    Sleep  5  need for hanging resources verification

Detach UE${UE_ID} and clear up test environment
    Stop tshark   alias=tcp_mss
    Detach UE  UE_ID=${UE_ID}

Set feature flag ${parameter} to ${value}
    Log to console  Set feature flag ${parameter} to ${value}
    ta_emss.Configure  {'MOC': 'NRBTS', 'ID': '1', '${parameter}': '${value}'}

Start ${mbps} mbps DL data traffic on PDU${PDU_ID} for UE${UE_ID}
    ${client_IP}=  evaluate  ${PDU_ID} + 1
    Log to console    Check done for UE_ID=${UE_ID}
    start iperf traffic
    ...  server=10.0.2.1
    ...  client=1.2.4.${client_IP}
    ...  port=7070
    ...  throughput=${mbps}M
    ...  duration=3
    ...  packet_size=1400
    ...  ip_version=ipv4
    ...  protocol=tcp
    sleep  5s  reason=wait for the iperf command

Start ${mbps} mbps UL data traffic for UE${UE_ID}
    Log to console    Check done for UE_ID=${UE_ID}
    start iperf traffic
    ...  server=10.0.2.1
    ...  client=72.23.0.1
    ...  port=7070
    ...  throughput=${mbps}M
    ...  duration=3
    ...  packet_size=1400
    ...  ip_version=ipv4
    ...  protocol=tcp
    sleep  5s  reason=wait for the iperf command

Start ${mbps} mbps DL data traffic in NSA mode for UE${UE_ID}
    Log to console    Check done for UE_ID=${UE_ID}
    start iperf traffic
    ...  server=10.0.2.1
    ...  client=4.7.254.208
    ...  port=7070
    ...  throughput=${mbps}M
    ...  duration=5
    ...  packet_size=1400
    ...  ip_version=ipv4
    ...  protocol=tcp
    sleep  5s  reason=wait for the iperf command

Verify value of MSS in TCP [SYN] packet
    [Arguments]  ${MSS}  ${source}  ${destination}
    Verify tshark
    ...   alias=tcp_mss
    ...   packet_filter=tcp.options.mss_val==${MSS} and tcp.flags.syn==1 and tcp.flags.ack==0 and ip.addr==${source} and ip.addr==${destination}
    ...   pass_criteria= >=1
    ...   timeout=20

Verify value of MSS in TCP [SYN,ACK] packet
    [Arguments]  ${MSS}  ${source}  ${destination}
    Verify tshark
    ...   alias=tcp_mss
    ...   packet_filter=tcp.options.mss_val==${MSS} and tcp.flags.syn==1 and tcp.flags.ack==1 and ip.addr==${source} and ip.addr==${destination}
    ...   pass_criteria= >=1
    ...   timeout=20
